## 13. Real-runtime testing requirement

Real-runtime testing remains required before merge readiness because this branch wires the first real execute-action/backend execution path.

Recommended Michael local Windows/MINGW64 run:

```bash
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestNativeWorkerBackendExecutionIntegration.mjs
```

Recommended real-runtime scenarios:

```text
executeAction(valid text.generate orchestration, stream: false) completes with completed outcome and non-empty result.text
executeAction(valid text.generate orchestration, stream: true) returns a readable stream and done resolves completed outcome
cancelPrompt(handle.requestId) after executeAction(...) maps done to cancelled outcome
prompt() still works after executeAction()
resetSession/resetModel/shutdown still behave after executeAction smoke
```

